Package: oocgroup
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: CGROUP MANAGER
 Creates and configures cgroup v2 resource limits for memory, cpu, and io controllers.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
